  "question": {
    "text": "The remainder when $428^{2024}$ is divided by 21 is__________"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "1",
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned}\n& (428)^{2024}=(420+8)^{2024} \\\\\n& =(21 \\times 20+8)^{2024} \\\\\n& =21 \\mathrm{~m}+8^{2024}\n\\end{aligned}$<br />Now $8^{2024}=\\left(8^2\\right)^{1012}$\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& =(64)^{1012} \\\\\n& =(63+1)^{1012} \\\\\n& =(21 \\times 3+1)^{1012} \\\\\n& =2 \\ln +1\n\\end{aligned}$\n$\\Rightarrow$ Remainder is 1."
  }
}